Most likely the file name is wrong - you probably intended to write  
\"C:\\\\dataSample_1.txt\".

Note that there is no error handling on Windows, so you should wrap  
your calls in try(..) unless you're sure that they won't fail. On  
unix everything works fine, of course ;).

Cheers,
Simon

